{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "23a2d914-3a34-8575-bd0d-3cf8ad2bfea1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:20:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:17:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about a dip in the road in front of my house. Where they dug up for the gas line, or whatever it was, a while back. The trench settled and now there's this dip, and after that storm Saturday it's full of water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the nor'easter, yep. Is it a pothole, or more of a sunken stretch where the patch was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sunken stretch. Like a bathtub, about as long as a car. I said to my neighbor, somebody's going to wreck an axle, and she said they patched it already, and I said, well, they patched it badly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that happens when the fill settles. Do you have a street name for me, or a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather not give the whole address on the phone. Can't I just tell you it's a utility trench and the bus goes by there? It's on a bus route, the buses hit it every twenty minutes, bang, and the whole house shakes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do need a location to send anybody out. Is there a cross street you're comfortable with, or the nearest intersection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, I'm carrying groceries up the stairs, I just got in. [pause] Okay, that's one landing. Sorry, I'm on the second, there's another one. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, the intersection. Let me think, it's near the corner by the bus stop, the one with the little shelter. I'll call back with the exact street if I have to. But how long do these repairs usually take? Because I called last year about something else, and I said when, and she said soon, and I said soon is not a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. After a storm the crews are stacked up with emergency stuff, so a settled trench can take a couple of weeks, sometimes longer in winter when the patch material isn't ideal. A cold-patch fix may come first and the permanent one in spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring. Wonderful. So the buses just keep banging through till April."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's deep enough to be a hazard, I can flag it for a quicker look. That's why the location matters. Want to give me the street now, or call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I'll call back. I'm on my last landing and my arm is going to fall off. My number's 401-555-0177 if somebody wants to reach me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0177, Josephine, you said? I'll note a sunken utility trench on a bus route, location to follow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Cirelli. Okay. Thanks, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, take care of that arm."
    }
  ],
